WEBVTT

00:00:09.142 --> 00:00:11.144
Love, Just on my love

00:00:11.144 --> 00:00:17.484
I want to protect you with these hands

00:00:27.661 --> 00:00:31.765
Do you know real men?

00:00:31.765 --> 00:00:35.903
They're weak to the women they protect

00:00:35.903 --> 00:00:40.107
Is he sweeter than me?

00:00:40.107 --> 00:00:44.211
Is he stronger than me?

00:00:46.446 --> 00:00:50.984
The night of the full moon is cold

00:00:50.984 --> 00:00:53.887
My soul is supposed to be in my hands

00:00:54.788 --> 00:01:03.263
My memories get moved to the shadows

00:01:05.265 --> 00:01:07.334
Love, Just on my love

00:01:07.334 --> 00:01:13.373
I want to protect you with these hands

00:01:13.674 --> 00:01:21.949
You taught me about women, love, and passion

00:01:59.186 --> 00:02:00.554
This is...

00:02:04.958 --> 00:02:06.326
Mariabelle...

00:02:07.060 --> 00:02:08.362
Cleao...

00:02:10.597 --> 00:02:13.200
What's the meaning of this?
You told me, didn't you?

00:02:13.200 --> 00:02:16.370
That if I gave you the sword,
there would be no danger!

00:02:17.004 --> 00:02:19.706
Give them back!
Give me back my children! Please!

00:02:28.115 --> 00:02:29.249
Master...

00:02:39.059 --> 00:02:40.227
Sword of Light, whom I do release!

00:02:40.227 --> 00:02:41.228
Stop!
Sword of Light, whom I do release!

00:02:41.228 --> 00:02:41.728
Sword of Light, whom I do release!

00:02:48.635 --> 00:02:52.339
So she wants to trade the two of them
for the Sword of Baltanders.

00:02:52.973 --> 00:02:54.041
Azalie!

00:03:00.681 --> 00:03:06.853
FrlENOS, come together
on OUR JOURNEY

00:03:07.120 --> 00:03:08.422
Here, the usual.

00:03:08.422 --> 00:03:09.356
Thanks.

00:03:13.593 --> 00:03:15.095
Say, Master...

00:03:15.629 --> 00:03:19.966
weren't those words on the wall
written in the code used by sorcerers?

00:03:20.534 --> 00:03:21.435
Yeah.

00:03:22.169 --> 00:03:25.138
| thought so. Are the girls all right?

00:03:25.138 --> 00:03:26.440
Probably, yeah.

00:03:26.440 --> 00:03:28.208
Probably? But that's...

00:03:31.311 --> 00:03:32.212
That's...

00:03:34.047 --> 00:03:36.883
This is its goal.

00:03:36.883 --> 00:03:40.153
Until this is in its hands,
it probably won't kill them.

00:03:40.654 --> 00:03:43.090
But where are they?

00:03:44.858 --> 00:03:46.526
That has nothing to do with you!

00:03:49.663 --> 00:03:53.066
If you have that much free time, why don't you
do something to help out your old man?

00:03:55.802 --> 00:03:57.904
Master, where are you going?

00:03:57.904 --> 00:03:59.439
I'm turning in for the night!

00:04:16.156 --> 00:04:20.393
Why in the world do we have to
clean up after him?!

00:04:20.393 --> 00:04:22.395
There's no helping it, Big Brother.

00:04:22.696 --> 00:04:27.667
This is our job, and because
we're working like this,

00:04:27.667 --> 00:04:30.036
we're able to pay back the debt.

00:04:30.804 --> 00:04:32.239
Why is it, Dortin?!

00:04:32.239 --> 00:04:36.443
Why did I borrow from a guy who
doesn't shed blood or even tears?

00:04:36.443 --> 00:04:37.277
Why?

00:04:37.644 --> 00:04:39.446
| don't know!

00:04:39.446 --> 00:04:42.182
Besides, you're the one in debt, Big Brother!

00:04:42.182 --> 00:04:43.583
What are you saying?!

00:04:43.583 --> 00:04:45.552
We two are one and the same!

00:04:45.552 --> 00:04:49.623
So my debt is your debt. Isn't that right?!

00:04:49.623 --> 00:04:51.625
But that's not...

00:04:56.596 --> 00:05:00.300
Cleao, Mariabelle, please, somehow be all right.

00:05:00.300 --> 00:05:04.371
No matter what it takes:
I, your mother, will definitely save you.

00:05:04.371 --> 00:05:05.438
Madame...

00:05:07.941 --> 00:05:10.377
| have something very important to tell you.

00:05:11.978 --> 00:05:13.013
Yes?

00:05:30.864 --> 00:05:32.199
Where am I?

00:05:34.734 --> 00:05:38.138
That's right, we...

00:05:46.513 --> 00:05:47.614
Big Sister!

00:05:51.351 --> 00:05:52.552
Big Sister!

00:05:55.021 --> 00:05:56.690
Big Sister, hang on!

00:05:56.690 --> 00:05:58.058
Big Sister!

00:06:03.230 --> 00:06:05.899
Cleao, what's wrong?

00:06:05.899 --> 00:06:07.567
You look so worried.

00:06:07.934 --> 00:06:12.806
You do realize, we've been
kidnapped by Bloody August?

00:06:12.806 --> 00:06:14.741
Now that you mention it...

00:06:14.741 --> 00:06:15.809
Geez...

00:06:17.477 --> 00:06:21.882
It seems Bloody August isn't here,
so we better get out now.

00:06:25.418 --> 00:06:26.720
It's all right.

00:06:26.720 --> 00:06:28.688
I'm sure he will come to rescue us.

00:06:28.688 --> 00:06:31.224
How can you come to that conclusion?

00:06:31.224 --> 00:06:34.794
For one thing, there's no reason why
Orphen would come to rescue us.

00:06:44.905 --> 00:06:46.806
What is all this?!

00:06:46.806 --> 00:06:50.877
Say, Cleao, why do you think
this room is so uneven?

00:06:50.877 --> 00:06:52.579
There's no way I could know...

00:06:59.619 --> 00:07:00.787
This is...

00:07:05.125 --> 00:07:08.628
Where I met Orphen for the first time.

00:07:35.522 --> 00:07:37.324
Master?

00:07:38.959 --> 00:07:40.593
You aren't going alone?!

00:07:40.593 --> 00:07:42.329
I'm going to save them.

00:07:42.329 --> 00:07:45.732
| can't hand this over to Bloody August.

00:07:46.232 --> 00:07:48.635
But you don't even know where they are!

00:07:48.635 --> 00:07:50.303
| have an idea.

00:07:50.670 --> 00:07:54.474
| don't think it's likely that
it's carrying them around with it.

00:07:56.476 --> 00:07:57.711
Master!

00:07:59.279 --> 00:08:03.049
You promised, didn't you?
That you would teach me magic!

00:08:07.020 --> 00:08:09.456
Have I ever broken a promise?

00:08:11.324 --> 00:08:12.325
No!

00:08:15.328 --> 00:08:18.698
So, could you lend me a hand, Majic?

00:08:26.039 --> 00:08:26.973
Away!

00:08:35.248 --> 00:08:38.184
Where are you planning to go, Krylancelo?

00:08:38.585 --> 00:08:40.086
Have you forgotten?

00:08:40.854 --> 00:08:44.024
I've always been good at tag.

00:08:44.891 --> 00:08:48.895
Now, give me the
Sword of Baltanders, Krylancelo!

00:09:00.840 --> 00:09:01.741
Away!

00:09:07.247 --> 00:09:09.482
It went well, didn't it, Master?

00:09:09.816 --> 00:09:10.917
Yeah.

00:09:12.085 --> 00:09:15.088
He's always been pathetic at hide and seek.

00:09:18.258 --> 00:09:19.292
See you!

00:10:00.633 --> 00:10:03.002
A-are you okay, Big Brother?

00:10:03.002 --> 00:10:05.672
There's no way I'd be okay, is there?

00:10:05.672 --> 00:10:08.241
I'll kill you with a lullaby!

00:10:08.241 --> 00:10:10.977
But there's no way to climb up
something like this!

00:10:10.977 --> 00:10:15.448
Insolence! There's someone who saw
the black lightning fall over there!

00:10:15.448 --> 00:10:18.485
I'm not wrong! That monster came this way!

00:10:19.452 --> 00:10:22.555
So there's no reason for us to go!

00:10:22.555 --> 00:10:23.656
What are you saying?!

00:10:23.656 --> 00:10:27.594
If we save her daughters,
then the reward money will come rolling in!

00:10:28.228 --> 00:10:33.566
With it we can repay that sorcerer,
and kill him with an entrance exam!

00:10:53.486 --> 00:10:54.921
Assume thy true form.

00:11:16.809 --> 00:11:18.545
The ruins of Kohan...

00:11:28.655 --> 00:11:30.823
| thought I'd die.

00:11:30.823 --> 00:11:33.159
It's because you went crazy
in a place like that, Big Brother.

00:11:33.159 --> 00:11:34.694
What did you say? It's because you...

00:11:34.694 --> 00:11:35.562
Big Brother!

00:11:35.995 --> 00:11:37.263
What is it?

00:11:42.735 --> 00:11:44.537
What's going on here?

00:11:44.537 --> 00:11:46.606
Big Brother, this is the aftermath of lightning!

00:11:46.606 --> 00:11:48.608
It came this way after all!

00:11:50.009 --> 00:11:53.446
Great! Great!
See, what I say is always right, isn't it?

00:11:53.446 --> 00:11:55.949
Then, Cleao and her sister are here too?

00:11:56.583 --> 00:11:57.817
| can't be wrong!

00:11:57.817 --> 00:12:02.555
Soon we'll be able to say goodbye
to our days of unjust suffering!

00:12:02.555 --> 00:12:05.792
Now, towards the settings sun...

00:12:23.643 --> 00:12:25.445
Big Sister, go for it!

00:12:26.346 --> 00:12:29.849
Just a little more!
But don't look down! Not down!

00:12:48.067 --> 00:12:49.636
Big Sister, hurry!

00:12:49.636 --> 00:12:51.804
Th-that's easier said than done...

00:13:10.423 --> 00:13:12.025
Big Sister!

00:13:14.727 --> 00:13:16.296
Cleao!

00:13:22.869 --> 00:13:24.137
Orphen...

00:13:26.572 --> 00:13:29.342
| can't hold on any longer!

00:13:32.178 --> 00:13:33.112
Orphen!

00:13:34.113 --> 00:13:36.983
Miss, you're safe now.

00:13:59.572 --> 00:14:01.140
You!

00:14:25.198 --> 00:14:26.599
You okay?

00:14:29.202 --> 00:14:30.970
Really, you try too hard.

00:14:30.970 --> 00:14:33.072
Couldn't you wait until I got here?

00:14:33.072 --> 00:14:34.240
I'm so sorry.

00:14:34.741 --> 00:14:38.611
Why are you acting so big?
We didn't even expect you to come!

00:14:38.611 --> 00:14:40.279
Is that so?

00:14:41.147 --> 00:14:42.148
It's coming.

00:14:53.659 --> 00:14:55.661
Hurry up and get away.

00:14:57.463 --> 00:14:59.298
What? But...

00:14:59.632 --> 00:15:02.034
Don't make me say the same thing twice.

00:15:04.036 --> 00:15:05.104
Cleao...

00:15:18.785 --> 00:15:20.586
So, you want this, do you?

00:15:21.287 --> 00:15:22.288
Azalie!

00:15:41.040 --> 00:15:43.543
Bring peace, Sleep of Atonement!

00:16:14.507 --> 00:16:16.042
I'm sorry, Azalie.

00:16:16.042 --> 00:16:20.112
| promise you that one day I will
return you to your true human form,

00:16:20.112 --> 00:16:23.015
by wielding the Sword of Baltanders.

00:16:27.653 --> 00:16:29.388
Spin around me, Armour of Ice!

00:16:38.764 --> 00:16:39.765
Come out!

00:16:39.765 --> 00:16:41.601
It's you, isn't it, Childman?!

00:16:44.136 --> 00:16:46.539
It's been a while, Krylancelo.

00:16:46.906 --> 00:16:49.375
You both still want Azalie's life!

00:16:49.375 --> 00:16:51.644
The command of the Tower of Fangs is absolute.

00:16:51.644 --> 00:16:52.979
What command?

00:16:52.979 --> 00:16:55.481
It's only your precious honor, isn't it?

00:16:56.282 --> 00:16:57.583
That's right.

00:16:57.884 --> 00:17:00.620
Look, I've bound Azalie.

00:17:00.620 --> 00:17:02.855
She'll not harm anyone again.

00:17:03.356 --> 00:17:06.826
This way allows you to maintain
your precious honor too, right?!

00:17:06.826 --> 00:17:08.861
You don't understand anything.

00:17:09.228 --> 00:17:12.298
Whom did you say you've bound?

00:17:20.907 --> 00:17:22.742
Sphere of Luminescence!

00:17:22.742 --> 00:17:24.577
Sword of Light, whom I do release!

00:17:27.246 --> 00:17:28.247
Idiot.

00:17:57.209 --> 00:17:58.544
Azalie!

00:18:08.754 --> 00:18:09.789
Azalie!

00:18:12.425 --> 00:18:13.826
You understand now, don't you?

00:18:13.826 --> 00:18:18.531
The power buried in the sword
can't yet be controlled by you or me!

00:18:19.298 --> 00:18:22.602
That sword can't return you to your true form!

00:18:25.605 --> 00:18:27.006
Wait, Azalie!

00:18:38.818 --> 00:18:40.886
Just as usual, right, Krylancelo?

00:18:41.187 --> 00:18:44.957
It seems you've learned nothing
these last five years.

00:18:46.158 --> 00:18:49.829
| will return Azalie to her true human form.

00:18:52.665 --> 00:18:54.000
You will leave it at that?

00:18:54.000 --> 00:18:55.735
The circumstances dictate
we have no other choice.

00:18:55.735 --> 00:18:57.269
We will return, and rework our strategy.

00:18:57.269 --> 00:18:58.471
To the Other Side.

00:19:22.895 --> 00:19:25.197
Majic, we're going soon.

00:19:25.197 --> 00:19:26.899
Yes, Master!

00:19:34.106 --> 00:19:39.512
Old man, are you sure it's okay?
To let the likes of me care for Majic?

00:19:39.512 --> 00:19:40.946
Don't worry about it, Orphen.

00:19:40.946 --> 00:19:42.948
It's the path Majic has chosen for himself.

00:19:42.948 --> 00:19:44.116
That's right!

00:19:44.116 --> 00:19:47.319
The only reason you're able to go
on a journey like this

00:19:47.319 --> 00:19:49.555
is because my father's paying my tuition.

00:19:49.555 --> 00:19:50.556
Right?

00:19:51.390 --> 00:19:54.360
Yeah. Be well, Majic.

00:19:55.494 --> 00:19:56.896
You too, Father.

00:19:58.731 --> 00:20:00.599
See you, old man.

00:20:27.626 --> 00:20:30.629
What'll we do from here, Master?

00:20:30.629 --> 00:20:34.834
Well, maybe we'll chase Volcan and company,
who ran off with the sword.

00:20:34.834 --> 00:20:38.237
Oh yeah, those two made it seem like
they rescued Cleao and her sister,

00:20:38.237 --> 00:20:40.706
and tried to get some money for it.

00:20:41.173 --> 00:20:43.442
Really, they're shameless.

00:20:43.776 --> 00:20:47.146
Which reminds me,
why don't you come out soon?

00:20:48.748 --> 00:20:49.648
Hi!

00:20:49.648 --> 00:20:51.550
Cleao, why?

00:20:51.550 --> 00:20:54.053
W-well, you know...

00:20:54.053 --> 00:20:55.454
The sword!

00:20:55.454 --> 00:21:00.126
Against my will, I have to go on a journey
to regain my father's sword!

00:21:01.160 --> 00:21:02.528
Cleao...

00:21:07.867 --> 00:21:09.068
Because...

00:21:09.068 --> 00:21:11.804
because that sword's a valuable
memento of my father!

00:21:11.804 --> 00:21:14.140
| really, really have to have it back!

00:21:15.708 --> 00:21:17.543
Well, isn't that nice?

00:21:23.282 --> 00:21:25.417
But that's just as expected of a sorcerer, isn't it?

00:21:25.417 --> 00:21:27.386
When did you find me out?

00:21:27.386 --> 00:21:29.021
The middle of last night.

00:21:29.021 --> 00:21:31.757
What? What?

00:21:31.991 --> 00:21:35.928
Y-you won't make me go home, will you?

00:21:35.928 --> 00:21:37.263
Who knows?

00:21:37.263 --> 00:21:41.767
If you do, I'll tell everyone you're a
perverted sorcerer who peeped at me!

00:21:41.767 --> 00:21:43.335
You're still mad about that?

00:21:43.335 --> 00:21:46.438
I'll have you know, even if I saw those things, I...

00:21:47.072 --> 00:21:48.574
"Those things?"

00:21:48.574 --> 00:21:49.942
Hard to breathe!

00:21:49.942 --> 00:21:54.180
I'm so sorry! So, I'm flat and there's
nothing interesting to see?!

00:21:54.180 --> 00:21:55.915
Cleao, calm down!

00:21:56.148 --> 00:21:58.484
It's dangerous if you go crazy like that!

00:22:00.152 --> 00:22:02.354
Hey, apologize already!

00:22:02.354 --> 00:22:03.422
You're stubborn!

00:22:03.422 --> 00:22:05.257
I'm never forgiving you!

00:22:05.257 --> 00:22:07.293
I'm saying it's dangerous!

00:22:14.233 --> 00:22:18.437
You can't, Cleao! You can't go to
Mount Kahlna without telling Master!

00:22:18.437 --> 00:22:21.006
There's a ferocious beast in those mountains!

00:22:21.006 --> 00:22:23.475
What? It's the legendary monster?

00:22:23.843 --> 00:22:28.314
Some kind of secret is hidden in
the flower gardens of Mount Kahlna.

00:22:28.314 --> 00:22:31.483
What is the Golden Blessing?

00:22:32.218 --> 00:22:34.086
Next time on Sorcerous Stabber Orphen:

00:22:34.086 --> 00:22:36.055
sleep In our flower Garden, Beast
"Sleep in Our Flower Garden, Beast."

00:22:36.055 --> 00:22:38.057
Sleep In our flower Garden, Beast
Sword of Light, whom I do release!

00:22:48.200 --> 00:22:52.271
You aren't here, the one I really love

00:22:52.271 --> 00:22:56.342
My first love has reached a dead end

00:22:56.809 --> 00:23:05.050
Tonight in my dreams, a smiling you doesn't appear

00:23:05.684 --> 00:23:09.722
Your last lines came out of your lips too soon

00:23:09.722 --> 00:23:13.325
You were troubled by

00:23:14.260 --> 00:23:18.197
Your last lines as soon as your lips said them

00:23:18.197 --> 00:23:21.934
But then you kissed me

00:23:23.002 --> 00:23:27.406
To only my lips

00:23:27.406 --> 00:23:31.610
Please give your warmth

00:23:31.610 --> 00:23:35.981
To only my lips

00:23:35.981 --> 00:23:39.852
Will you always remain

00:23:40.119 --> 00:23:42.588
A gentle you

00:23:42.588 --> 00:23:46.759
To only my lips

00:23:46.759 --> 00:23:51.063
No matter how hard I try to forget

00:23:51.063 --> 00:23:55.334
To only my lips

00:23:55.334 --> 00:24:01.540
Will you always remain

00:24:01.874 --> 00:24:06.478
The last of you
